# Vercel serves the static console and project page only. The examination engine runs
# on a Docker Space, because a serverless bundle cannot hold PyTorch.
#
# api/ is listed first for a specific reason: Vercel auto-detects api/*.py as
# serverless functions and will happily build a Python lambda from the FastAPI app
# that then fails at runtime on the torch import. Excluding it keeps the deployment
# honestly static instead of shipping a broken endpoint.
api/
peri/
train/
tools/
tests/
artifacts/
evidence/
data/
docs/
.venv/
__pycache__/
*.pt
*.zip
